# A campaign, begun new: the campaign map, the move into a region, its battle with every unit
# resting, the Hall of Fame, the campaign's result, and Main Menu. It checks REGIONS.SAV, which
# the end of the battle writes.
#! seed 6
#! timeout 600
#! files REGIONS.SAV

# Pauses that any key ends; a unit's command: rest; a menu with the letter C (the Confederate
# move on the campaign map and the combat menu): its first entry; Pursue ? and Stack Units: No.
rule 1 key space
rule 5 key space
rule 2:C key enter
rule 2:P key enter
rule 2:S key enter

# Campaign Game; Begin NEW.
play until 2:M
digest
text c
prompt
digest
text b

# The first command of the battle; then every unit rests to the end.
play until 5
digest
key space

# The Hall of Fame.
play until 4
text Tester
key enter

# The campaign's result: Options, Main Menu.
play until 2:O
digest
text m
play until 2:M
digest

# Quit, Yes.
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
